 ```
 
-Install them with:
-
-```powershell
-python -m pip install numpy pandas scipy
-```
-
-If SciPy is unavailable, the script still performs timestamp-based linear resampling but skips the FIR filtering step.
-
+[Source/schema, checksums, boundary tests and provenance](docs/wisdm_identity.md) describe the full contract. The [merged runnable project](https://github.com/VariableThe/gait-biometrics) contains full model training/evaluation. Neither these exports nor subject separation establishes cross-session continuous authentication.
